+**Observed:** Six Foundation titles and five Architecture-role entries have no operational Markdown links. There is no source history, input digest or provenance for the two unnamed views; source presence does not prove unseen owner specifications or completed peer cycles.
+
+**Proposed correction:** Add real source links with role and edition/coverage limits, correct the role of Concepts versus structural allocation, and record actual input/history and before/after evidence. Identify replaced views by original section and exact received-view digest, without inventing prior view IDs. Keep historical central pending statements as event-time records and state current results separately.
+
+**Closure criterion:** All eleven unique references resolve to actual supplied IDs; local history and exact view provenance are verifiable. No unseen specification, historic author, implemented capability or peer validation is inferred.
+
+**Related records:** ARC003-W02; DF-RVW-001 §§4/6/7. **State:** Open.
